bin/
obj/
data/
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.md
# ...except the in-app operator guide embedded by DocsEndpoints (/docs/osrm.md). It is
# a .md source file that MUST reach the build context so `dotnet publish` can embed it
# into the assembly; the blanket *.md rule above would otherwise strip it from the image.
!Endpoints/Docs/osrm.md
*.sln
*.user
*.DotSettings*
Properties/launchSettings.json
**/node_modules/
**/*.Tests/
**/*.Tests.csproj
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
.env
.env.*
tailwindcss-windows-x64.exe
# Local dev state must never be baked into the image. The "data/" rule above is
# case-sensitive on Linux builders, so also exclude these explicitly (on Windows
# the dev data dir collides with the source Data/ folder).
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/oauth-signing.key
**/oauth-encryption.key
appdata/
